WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.640 position:61%
<i>The rumours... still haven't gone away.</i>

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.400
<i>I've learned more about humiliation
in the past few weeks</i>

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.120
<i>than I hoped I would in a lifetime.</i>

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.760
You married a wild spirit.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.120
<i>Trying to tame them is no use.</i>

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.360
<i>I've been queen barely ten years.</i>

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:33.160
<i>And in that time...
I've had three Prime Ministers.</i>

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:37.280
Not one has lasted the course.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.080
I understand the Prime Minister's
resignation and all--

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.000
It's not just the Prime Minister.

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.080
<i>And your mother, and your sister,
and your country...</i>

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.200
<i>The whole relentlessness of it all.</i>

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.600
<i>The fact it never stops,
not for a minute.</i>

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.600
<i>But is it not possible that
among all those problems...</i>

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:07.120 position:58%
there are some of us
who are there for you no matter what?

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:09.920
If only.

